        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Chi Cheng seeks it for evasion.",
        "chapters": [
          62
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Gu Yue Bo names the gain as increased dodging ability.",
        "chapters": [
          63
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "In the mid-year wild-boar exam he uses it to leap three meters aside and avoid a falling tree.",
        "chapters": [
          73
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "On the year-end arena he jumps around with high agility to stay out of close combat, then answers with moonblades.",
        "chapters": [
          82
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Against Fang Zheng the Gu lets him retreat ten meters in one light leap, and Fang Zheng treats each use as spending a set amount of primeval essence. Chi Cheng also frames it as the speed edge Fang Zheng lacks on that stage.",
        "chapters": [
          83
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After the pick, academy and group scenes keep the Gu as his mobility tool. He boasts that Fang Yuan lacks the same Gu while watching Fang Yuan struggle.",
        "chapters": [
          84
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "chi-chengs-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "On a later mountain run with Chi Shan’s group he uses it from time to time to keep up when the pace wears him down.",
        "chapters": [
          93
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "chi-chengs-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_chi_shan"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
